s example stories and concrete steps to help you thrive in any work situation.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOf course, much as we love to blame our bosses, sometimes management isn’t the problem at all. For every bad boss there is also a lazy employee, so Erikson also looks at the issue from a completely different perspective―employees themselves― and explores why some colleagues frequently underachieve, and what you can do to change this if you're the boss.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWritten with Erikson's signature humor and warmth, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-text-italic\"\u003eSurrounded by Bad Bosses (And Lazy Employees)\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ewill help you deal with the most hopeless managers and employees you can imagine―and keep you entertained along the way.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Thomas Erikson\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9781785043406\u003cbr\u003eFormate: paperback\u003cbr\u003ePages: 385\u003cbr\u003eDimensions: 127 x 195\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44318699782297,"sku":"13RD9781785042188","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/surroundedbybad.jpg?v=1715436396"},{"product_id":"magic-weight-loss-pill","title":"Magic Weight-Loss Pill","description":"\u003cp\u003eDimensions:20 x 203  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Luke Coutinho \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780143443223 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 296\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44899881648281,"sku":"11RE9780143443223","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c3d37550c518dd0d9f80c778b52de3d4.jpg?v=1729075382"},{"product_id":"cosmic-ordering-the-next-adventure","title":"Cosmic Ordering: The Next Adventure","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe p